dde-dock-panon (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New effect: 弹球 — energy bars with color mapped by intensity + bouncing ball atop each bar
  * Auto-update: check GitHub releases for new versions, show download prompt in menu
  * Persist settings (effect, width, color mode, audio source) via QSettings
  * Boost high-frequency sensitivity with quadratic frequency weighting
  * All effects: switched from top-bottom to left-right channel mirroring
  * Default width changed from 200px to 150px
  * Fix: std::min type deduction conflict (int vs qsizetype) on GCC 12

